f configured vs observed vocabulary on status, type, and link axes (hierarchy excluded by design, unobservable in Data Center probe) and emit one drift finding per divergence naming the axis and absent value."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787531752727294001,"uuid":"78624b7e-f5c8-4974-b3fe-780eed946ef0"}